WEBVTT

00:01:31.560 --> 00:01:33.150
Scissor Swing!

00:01:33.150 --> 00:01:46.200
Dranzer!

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:54.440
Rip him in two, Sickle-weasel!

00:02:01.700 --> 00:02:07.140
The group who stole the stone tablet sent
a Blader who can control the wind after us.

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:12.250
The BBA team had no idea
how to fight an invisible enemy.

00:02:12.250 --> 00:02:17.140
Kai let his own Bey get damaged
to find his opponent's weakness.

00:02:17.140 --> 00:02:19.210
And amazingly, won!

00:02:30.320 --> 00:02:32.900
Go, Shoot!

00:02:46.860 --> 00:02:50.150
You're as slow as ever.

00:02:50.150 --> 00:02:55.190
You won't beat the four Sacred Beasts
like that! Or even one from the tablet!

00:02:55.190 --> 00:02:59.760
Aren't you getting cocky just
because you beat Byakko?

00:02:59.760 --> 00:03:03.080
If you don't like it,
then you go beat one!

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:06.860
Not that you could in a million years!
Not with your skills.

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:08.820
You went there.

00:03:08.820 --> 00:03:10.800
So what if I did?

00:03:11.440 --> 00:03:13.870
Cut it out, you two.

00:03:13.870 --> 00:03:15.790
Dunga started it.

00:03:15.790 --> 00:03:17.640
I was just tellin' it like it is!

00:03:17.640 --> 00:03:18.400
What?

00:03:18.400 --> 00:03:19.840
Sis.

00:03:20.960 --> 00:03:24.460
I can't take what this numbskull
said to me sitting down.

00:03:24.690 --> 00:03:26.610
So you're on.

00:03:27.430 --> 00:03:29.150
Now that's more like it.

00:03:29.150 --> 00:03:31.410
Go grab one of
the four Sacred Beasts!

00:03:31.410 --> 00:03:34.790
I'll even do my best dog or monkey
impression if you get one!

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:45.520
What's the deal, Kyoujyu?
I'm still sleepy...

00:03:46.420 --> 00:03:48.430
Where is Takao?

00:03:48.430 --> 00:03:49.730
Fast asleep.

00:03:49.730 --> 00:03:51.620
That's no good!

00:03:51.620 --> 00:03:53.570
You have to
wake him up!

00:03:53.570 --> 00:03:55.610
Yeah, but...

00:03:55.610 --> 00:04:00.310
Oh well. Shall we
test with Genbu alone?

00:04:00.310 --> 00:04:01.620
Test?

00:04:01.620 --> 00:04:03.450
The Bit Finder.

00:04:03.450 --> 00:04:05.810
I stayed up all
night upgrading it.

00:04:05.810 --> 00:04:10.130
But do we have to do
it this early, Kyoujyu?

00:04:10.130 --> 00:04:16.220
Of course! We don't know when those tablet thieves will come after us again!

00:04:16.220 --> 00:04:19.690
If we want to protect your
Sacred Beasts, we need to

00:04:19.690 --> 00:04:22.670
be able to accurately analyze the power of other ones.

00:04:22.670 --> 00:04:25.490
This is a top priority!

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:29.730
I get that, but I want
to sleep a little longer...

00:04:30.220 --> 00:04:32.570
All set. Ready, Max!

00:04:32.570 --> 00:04:33.830
Okay.

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:36.070
Go, Shoot!

00:04:43.250 --> 00:04:44.530
There it is!

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:52.960
Sorry, but Genbu's mine.

00:04:59.160 --> 00:05:00.340
Who's there?!

00:05:06.310 --> 00:05:08.290
I'm Dennis.

00:05:08.290 --> 00:05:10.370
I'm here to take Genbu!

00:05:10.370 --> 00:05:11.710
Genbu...?

00:05:12.030 --> 00:05:15.290
Are you from the group
that stole the tablet?

00:05:16.930 --> 00:05:19.320
Go, my Jurassic Sacred Beast!

00:05:19.320 --> 00:05:20.840
Tyranno!

00:05:35.330 --> 00:05:39.010
Go! Defeat Draciel!

00:05:40.160 --> 00:05:43.590
Okay, let's fight. Draciel!

00:06:00.410 --> 00:06:03.410
That Sacred Beast's
not half bad.

00:06:03.410 --> 00:06:06.670
What's going on here?

00:06:06.670 --> 00:06:11.920
This Sacred Beast should be capable
of much more powerful attacks!

00:06:11.920 --> 00:06:15.680
And yet, he isn't taking
advantage of it at all! Why?

00:06:15.680 --> 00:06:17.000
How?

00:06:17.410 --> 00:06:19.220
Return, Tyranno!

00:06:29.380 --> 00:06:30.530
Wait!

00:06:31.630 --> 00:06:33.220
Wait!!

00:06:34.150 --> 00:06:35.770
Max!

00:06:35.770 --> 00:06:38.810
This is bad!
I have to alert the others!

00:07:13.330 --> 00:07:15.300
What's up with this room?

00:07:27.520 --> 00:07:30.010
You fell for it!

00:07:30.370 --> 00:07:34.770
Now I get it. You baited me into
following you all the way out here.

00:07:35.980 --> 00:07:37.840
It's time to battle!

00:07:39.160 --> 00:07:42.080
The one and only Dennis
is gonna take Genbu!

00:07:42.080 --> 00:07:44.450
Try to take it if you dare!

00:07:44.450 --> 00:07:46.360
System standby.

00:07:51.620 --> 00:07:54.580
I don't know what's
going on here, but...

00:07:54.580 --> 00:07:58.600
I'll sit back and
watch this battle.

00:07:58.980 --> 00:08:02.300
And once Draciel
has been weakened,

00:08:02.300 --> 00:08:04.240
Genbu's as good as mine.

00:08:04.240 --> 00:08:08.030
Here we go!
Three! Two! One!

00:08:08.030 --> 00:08:10.210
Go, Shoot!

00:08:14.070 --> 00:08:16.100
Go, Draciel!

00:08:23.360 --> 00:08:26.110
Now it's... this way!

00:08:28.300 --> 00:08:31.050
Tyranno!

00:08:38.710 --> 00:08:41.020
Activate the
power-up system.

00:08:41.020 --> 00:08:43.600
Initiating energy injection!

00:09:00.830 --> 00:09:05.820
Tyranno, I'm giving you power that'll ensure
you won't lose to the four Sacred Beasts.

00:09:12.490 --> 00:09:15.300
Go! Destroy Draciel!

00:09:27.210 --> 00:09:28.610
Draciel!

00:09:29.680 --> 00:09:31.810
It's powerful!

00:09:35.640 --> 00:09:37.530
Attack him with
all you've got.

00:09:37.770 --> 00:09:39.690
Energy injection!

00:09:45.670 --> 00:09:47.860
It's approaching
critical rotation!

00:09:47.860 --> 00:09:51.580
Keep it there if that's what
it takes to get Genbu! Go!

00:09:55.930 --> 00:09:57.610
What incredible power!

00:09:57.890 --> 00:09:59.710
Over there!

00:09:59.710 --> 00:10:01.580
Max is in there!

00:10:02.060 --> 00:10:03.300
Let's go!

00:10:08.020 --> 00:10:10.700
This is too cruel,
even for me.

00:10:20.240 --> 00:10:23.650
Stop it!!

00:10:24.820 --> 00:10:27.270
What?! When did she--?!

00:10:27.270 --> 00:10:29.390
It has surpassed
critical rotation!

00:10:29.390 --> 00:10:32.240
Go, Sharcrash!

00:10:42.260 --> 00:10:43.540
What's the matter?

00:10:43.540 --> 00:10:45.140
It's at its limit!

00:10:50.690 --> 00:10:52.110
Tyranno!

00:11:16.180 --> 00:11:17.530
Max...

00:11:30.780 --> 00:11:32.130
Looks like we're trapped.

00:11:32.130 --> 00:11:33.380
Yeah.

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:39.740
Thank you.

00:11:40.490 --> 00:11:45.850
He might have taken Genbu
if you didn't jump in.

00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:50.300
Draciel was at its limit.

00:11:50.300 --> 00:11:54.700
If Sharcrash had attacked
Genbu instead of Tyranno,

00:11:54.700 --> 00:11:57.920
you would have really
been able to take Genbu.

00:11:59.290 --> 00:12:00.910
Really, now?

00:12:00.910 --> 00:12:02.460
I should have taken it.

00:12:02.460 --> 00:12:03.550
Huh?

00:12:03.550 --> 00:12:07.130
Isn't it obvious?
We're enemies.

00:12:07.130 --> 00:12:09.400
I didn't think that far.

00:12:10.750 --> 00:12:13.410
Did you feel
bad for Tyranno?

00:12:13.880 --> 00:12:15.610
Oh, shut up.

00:12:16.130 --> 00:12:19.600
I just didn't want
him to take Genbu.

00:12:19.600 --> 00:12:21.010
That's all.

00:12:21.010 --> 00:12:25.730
Our mission is to seal
the four Sacred Beasts.

00:12:26.340 --> 00:12:28.910
So it's not like
I saved you.

00:12:30.750 --> 00:12:35.330
Either way, we need to think about
how we're going to get out of here.

00:12:35.330 --> 00:12:38.180
We'll fight after that.

00:12:39.790 --> 00:12:42.120
Max!

00:12:43.590 --> 00:12:46.210
Dang. It's completely blocked!

00:12:46.210 --> 00:12:49.330
Okay. I'll open a
hole with Driger.

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:52.100
Rei! Are you crazy?

00:12:52.100 --> 00:12:53.290
Why?

00:12:53.290 --> 00:12:57.940
If you break this place apart more,
won't it just put them in more danger?

00:12:58.080 --> 00:13:01.400
Right! Calm down, Rei!

00:13:02.150 --> 00:13:04.610
Let's search for
a different path!

00:13:05.650 --> 00:13:07.650
Don't give up, Max.

00:13:07.650 --> 00:13:09.720
We'll save you.

00:13:32.650 --> 00:13:34.690
We have to go back.

00:13:34.690 --> 00:13:36.910
That way's a dead end.

00:13:36.910 --> 00:13:39.070
We have to go this way.

00:13:52.470 --> 00:13:53.500
Here.

00:13:54.090 --> 00:13:55.320
Hurry.

00:14:01.780 --> 00:14:03.710
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:14:03.710 --> 00:14:06.010
We're enemies.

00:14:09.430 --> 00:14:12.420
What're you spacing
out for? This way.

00:14:20.280 --> 00:14:22.400
We're heading down.

00:14:25.970 --> 00:14:27.200
Mariam!

00:14:38.330 --> 00:14:40.500
Thanks. You saved me.

00:14:41.450 --> 00:14:43.130
Are you hurt?

00:14:43.130 --> 00:14:46.280
I'm fine.
It's nothing serious.

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:48.720
Just let me see it.

00:14:48.720 --> 00:14:50.190
It's fine!

00:14:50.190 --> 00:14:54.500
It's not fine. What if we leave it and
it ends up being something serious?

00:14:55.640 --> 00:14:56.600
Okay.

00:14:56.600 --> 00:14:58.670
So let me see it.

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:04.300
I might have had the wrong
idea about you, Mariam.

00:15:05.050 --> 00:15:10.770
But from our perspective, the Psykicks,
the group from before, and your team...

00:15:10.770 --> 00:15:13.570
You're all our enemies,
after our four Sacred Beasts.

00:15:13.570 --> 00:15:16.930
So I thought you
were just like them.

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:19.130
Are you kidding me?

00:15:19.640 --> 00:15:22.720
Don't lump me
in with them!

00:15:24.100 --> 00:15:25.120
Ow!

00:15:25.120 --> 00:15:27.020
Sorry, did that hurt?

00:15:27.020 --> 00:15:31.490
I accidentally put too much force
because you say stuff like that!

00:15:31.490 --> 00:15:33.510
Okay, I'm done.

00:15:34.000 --> 00:15:35.590
Let's stop all this.

00:15:35.590 --> 00:15:39.210
Fighting to steal the four
Sacred Beasts and stuff...

00:15:39.730 --> 00:15:42.660
Those aren't what
real battles are.

00:15:42.660 --> 00:15:47.600
I've been thinking about it. We
can have a good battle together.

00:15:47.910 --> 00:15:50.490
Between us as Bladers.

00:15:50.490 --> 00:15:53.330
And here I thought you
were on to something.

00:15:54.090 --> 00:15:55.950
You don't get it either.

00:15:55.950 --> 00:15:56.930
Huh?

00:15:57.230 --> 00:16:01.880
Like I said, our mission is to
seal the four Sacred Beasts.

00:16:01.880 --> 00:16:05.790
But doesn't that mean
you're just like the others?

00:16:05.790 --> 00:16:08.220
What does your Sacred
Beast mean to you?

00:16:08.220 --> 00:16:11.490
Is it just a tool to seal
our four Sacred Beasts?

00:16:12.620 --> 00:16:14.560
That can't be it.

00:16:14.560 --> 00:16:18.720
Sacred Beasts aren't just tools.
You believe that too, Mariam.

00:16:18.720 --> 00:16:20.400
That's why you...

00:16:28.150 --> 00:16:31.800
What I do is my business!
Stay out of it!

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:33.020
But that's--

00:16:33.020 --> 00:16:38.400
Save it. Like I said, our mission is
to seal the four Sacred Beasts.

00:16:38.650 --> 00:16:39.950
End of story.

00:16:39.950 --> 00:16:41.120
Sacred Beasts are--

00:16:41.120 --> 00:16:43.010
If you want!

00:16:43.570 --> 00:16:46.990
If you want, we can just
settle things right here.

00:16:49.130 --> 00:16:52.740
Okay. We'll fight once
we get out of here.

00:16:55.460 --> 00:16:57.280
As long as
you understand.

00:16:57.780 --> 00:16:59.650
How's it over there?

00:16:59.650 --> 00:17:02.150
I can get about halfway in!

00:17:02.150 --> 00:17:03.780
No luck here!

00:17:03.780 --> 00:17:06.690
There's nowhere
for us to get in!

00:17:06.690 --> 00:17:09.620
Don't give up!
Search one more time!

00:17:16.980 --> 00:17:17.960
An exit!

00:17:17.960 --> 00:17:19.270
Yeah.

00:17:19.270 --> 00:17:22.270
But how do we get
all the way up there?

00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:29.710
There will do.

00:17:29.710 --> 00:17:31.630
Mariam. Get back.

00:17:31.630 --> 00:17:33.720
What's your game?

00:17:35.540 --> 00:17:37.200
You wouldn't!

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:39.540
Yeah. There's no other option.

00:17:39.540 --> 00:17:42.240
I'll use Draciel to break
this place apart.

00:17:42.240 --> 00:17:44.640
There's no guarantee
we can make it out.

00:17:44.640 --> 00:17:47.530
And I don't know
how long I can last.

00:17:47.530 --> 00:17:52.680
It's all or nothing. If Draciel falters
here, you go on ahead Mariam.

00:17:52.680 --> 00:17:53.650
Got it?

00:17:55.960 --> 00:17:57.530
Suit yourself.

00:17:57.530 --> 00:17:59.840
Hurry up and hide.

00:18:05.850 --> 00:18:07.680
Let's do it.

00:18:08.930 --> 00:18:11.010
I'm counting on you, Draciel.

00:18:14.110 --> 00:18:16.970
Go...

00:18:18.700 --> 00:18:20.280
Shoot!

00:18:26.170 --> 00:18:29.110
Go, Draciel!

00:18:38.390 --> 00:18:39.860
Mariam!

00:19:07.950 --> 00:19:09.120
Hurry!

00:19:33.540 --> 00:19:35.830
We're saved!

00:19:35.830 --> 00:19:37.000
Yeah.

00:19:37.000 --> 00:19:38.910
No more help.

00:19:38.910 --> 00:19:40.010
What?

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:47.690
Get ready.

00:19:53.350 --> 00:19:57.450
Max!

00:19:58.820 --> 00:20:00.530
Backup, huh?

00:20:00.530 --> 00:20:03.620
I won't let you get away
next time, so get ready!

00:20:04.680 --> 00:20:06.050
Mariam!

00:20:06.500 --> 00:20:08.820
--Max!
--Max!

00:20:12.340 --> 00:20:14.240
Are you okay, Max?

00:20:14.240 --> 00:20:15.820
Are you hurt?

00:20:15.820 --> 00:20:17.140
Yeah.

00:20:17.140 --> 00:20:18.940
We were worried about you!

00:20:18.940 --> 00:20:21.300
Where's that Dennis guy?

00:20:21.300 --> 00:20:22.930
He ran away.

00:20:22.930 --> 00:20:24.280
Is that so?

00:20:24.280 --> 00:20:28.720
Darn it! I won't forgive them
for putting you through this!

00:20:28.720 --> 00:20:31.570
I'm really glad you're safe.

00:20:36.240 --> 00:20:39.300
Sorry for worrying you.

00:20:49.250 --> 00:20:53.750
You talked big but came
back empty-handed!

00:20:53.750 --> 00:20:58.510
You lost the right to
talk down to me!

00:20:58.510 --> 00:21:03.100
But forcing a Sacred
Beast to power up...

00:21:03.100 --> 00:21:06.960
What will those crazy
scientists cook up next?

00:21:06.960 --> 00:21:10.210
We need to take care of them
sooner rather than later.

00:21:10.210 --> 00:21:12.250
So are we doin' it?

00:21:12.530 --> 00:21:14.050
Yeah.

00:21:14.050 --> 00:21:18.590
We will seal Genbu,
Suzaku, and Seiryu.

00:21:23.810 --> 00:21:25.310
Max...

00:21:25.970 --> 00:21:29.060
I will take Genbu from you.
You can count on it.

00:21:32.800 --> 00:21:34.800
No second chances.

00:22:59.520 --> 00:23:03.840
Ozma's team finally challenges
Takao's team to a final showdown.

00:23:03.840 --> 00:23:07.570
The first battle for the four Sacred Beasts will be Max VS Mariam.

00:23:07.570 --> 00:23:10.430
Who will be the winner
of this fated battle?

00:23:10.430 --> 00:23:13.300
What do you think,
Chairman? Huh?

00:23:13.300 --> 00:23:17.120
"A fated battle's
winner is fated too"?

00:23:17.120 --> 00:23:21.920
I can't take this anymore! Make sure to watch next week, too!
